{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DarkVein</strong> is a <strong>third-person tactical RPG</strong> set in a vast open world filled with life, mystery, and danger.<br>Amid dense forests, lakes, and ancient ruins lurks a threat \u2014 <strong>infected creatures</strong> that were once human.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players must <strong>survive</strong>, <strong>build shelters</strong>, <strong>gather resources</strong>, and <strong>fight for every day</strong>.<br>Combat relies on <strong>tactics, stamina management</strong>, and <strong>environmental awareness</strong>, where even nature itself can become an ally \u2014 or an enemy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DarkVein</strong> blends a sense of <strong>calm and danger</strong>, turning every journey into a fight for survival.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4035660?t=1762272317","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4035660/ccc219cdf970b7a27ccfdd519fc9208dfdca27b7/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1762272317","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4035660/f3c56407d3b4f8c7db57988dd115b45cf8be2ada/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762272317","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4035660/f3c56407d3b4f8c7db57988dd115b45cf8be2ada/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762272317","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DarkVein</strong> is a <strong>third-person tactical RPG</strong> set in a vast open world filled with life, mystery, and danger.<br>Amid dense forests, lakes, and ancient ruins lurks a threat \u2014 <strong>infected creatures</strong> that were once human.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players must <strong>survive</strong>, <strong>build shelters</strong>, <strong>g